 "text": "-->\nGrain | PCA Coop\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nContact Us\nForms\nWeather\nCareers\nNews\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Company\nBoard of Directors\nLeadership\nLocations\nDivisions\nGrain\nFeed\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFarm Stores\nCash Bids\nCash Bids\nFutures\nPCA Portal\nGrain\nWith multiple grain facilities, in-house merchandisers and a company-owned fleet, PCA can handle your every grain marketing need. Our team not only merchandises grain from our facilities, but we also manage a direct ship business whose goal is to maximize producer profits by offering a variety of contracting and delivery options.\nMarketing Programs\nAt PCA, our Grain Marketing Program is designed to help local producers market their grain with confidence. We offer competitive cash bids, forward contracting options, storage solutions, and timely market updates — all backed by a team that understands your operation and your goals.\nBecause every bushel matters, and so does the partnership behind it.\nView Our Programs\nGirard Elevator\n300 E Buffalo St Girard, KS 66743\nGirard Agronomy\n164 W 640th Ave Girard, KS 66743\nLiberal\n1246 W Hwy K Liberal, MO 64762\nMoundville\n227 S Broadway Moundville , MO 64771\nRich Hill\n522 S 14th St Rich Hill, MO 64779\nWaco\n375 Main St Waco, MO 64832\nmarketing Support\n5+ Million Bushel capacity\nForward Contracting options\nPick-up/\nDelivery\nExperienced Merchandising team\nCash Bids\nVISIT US\nPhone\nLocation\n800-442-2809\n300 E Buffalo St\nGirard, KS 66743\nPO Box 323\nPrivacy & Terms of Service\n2025 PCA\nAll Rights Reserved\nFollow Us\nContact u s\nSubmit\nThanks for submitting!\nbottom of page",
